  "historyNote": "#10687, eff 10-7-14; amd by #13290, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 11-16-21, EXPIRED: 5-15-22 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Gen 400); ss by #13556, eff 4-11-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Gen 400)",
